 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You have heard of Velinadu. What did your hills tell you?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Stories. Of company men who thought themselves safe until women closed the gates on them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Of queens who could sign treaties without asking anyone's permission.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Stories travel badly. But the bones of that one are not wrong.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Remember that when you meet Revathi. She carries those bones in her tongue.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "GUARD"
   ],
   "text": "Amma. You come early.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "GUARD"
   ],
   "text": "And this?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "A rider from the north whom the sea sent back to us. The Maharaja plays with him. I thought Velinadu should have its share.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You stand in a place where land, not men, is the first thing named.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Do not address her as if she were a sardar's daughter waiting for a husband to give her meaning.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If I forget, I expect you to kick me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "That can be arranged.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "They will make you wait. That is part of the weighing.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Padmini Amma. You come with interesting company.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Revathi Bayi. You asked to see what the southern winds had blown in.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "I brought him before the salt left his skin.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You are the Maratha rider. The one the Portuguese could not quite break and the sea could not quite keep.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "So they tell me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You speak our tongue?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I learn it. Slowly. Like a horse finding its footing on new ground.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Good. Men who refuse to learn languages normally insist theirs is the only one that matters.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Those men bore me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Sit. If you crane your neck the whole time, you will despise me before we have even argued.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You ride for Marthanda Varma now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I ride where I am told. At present, that is for your king.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "My king.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "He takes heads when he must and lands when he can. He calls this kingdom his.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "That does not mean the earth beneath his feet has forgotten who owned it before.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You prefer the old ways?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I prefer ways that remember their promises.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "The Velinadu line signed pacts with foreigners long before your Maratha court ever saw a European.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "We bled when those pacts were broken. We killed when they thought our hands too soft to hold swords.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "And you. What letters do you carry on your skin, Sawant?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "A brand. Some scars. Joints that ache in the rain. Nothing a scribe would waste ink on.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You underestimate scribes. They love scars.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "They say you trained the Madurai horse on wet sand.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You think you can teach our men to kill Dutch as easily as you killed Portuguese on your hills?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "The ground does not care whose blood it drinks.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Yet you keep pouring. Why?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Because in Goa, they tried to erase my name and replace it with a number in their books.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I have seen their hunger.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Give them an inch of riverbank, and they will swallow the whole valley before you have finished signing their treaty.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "On that, we agree.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "This land belongs to my line.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Not to my husband, if I take one. Not to my sons, if I have them. To my sisters. To their daughters. To the name we carry.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "The company men thought if they pleased the right man, signed the right paper, they owned the pepper, the trees, the very wind.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Now they send different men, different papers.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Your king is not a fool. Yet he also wants to pull all power into his own hands.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "He builds a state that answers to the crown, not to the old lines.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "That is good for facing Europeans. It is less good for those of us whose names are older than his.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "My mother's cousin sits in Kottarakkara. Savitri. Of the Elayadathu line.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "She writes to me sometimes. About the old ways. About what is owed.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Kottarakkara has not yet bent.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Your king circles that house the way a dog circles a wounded bird.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You fear he will use men like me to cut your houses down.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I do not fear. Fear is for people who have no knives.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I see him giving land and commands to men like you, whose ties to this coast are thin.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Easier to shift such men when the time comes. Harder for them to say no.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Will you say no, Nagoji Sawant, when he points you at a house that will not bow as deeply as he likes?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "If he tells you my pepper fields shelter Dutch spies, will you burn them for him?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I ride for the orders I am given. But I choose which king I allow to give them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "That choice is not made lightly.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You have already made it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You could have run north when the sea spat you out. Instead you stayed.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Do not pretend you stand at a crossroads when your feet are already on the path.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I stayed because he fights Europeans.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "So you chose him.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Understand that you also chose to stand on the other side of some doors when they close.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "They groom you. The Maharaja tests your judgment. Padmini warms your feet at her hearth so your loyalty tastes local.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You will be offered many things. Land. Honour. Perhaps even a wife from some house that can make you feel rooted here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Not from mine.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Men like you rarely have to ask. The world falls over itself to give them offers.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "I state my position early.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Come. The others will want to see that Padmini has not brought a complete fool into our courtyard.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Then you will go back to the Maharaja and tell him Velinadu smiled at you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Tell him also that we are still watching.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "And Nagoji. When your horses trample that wet sand, they trample land that belongs to more than one king.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Every hoofprint has a name beneath it. Learn those names.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You did not disgrace yourself.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I am not sure she agrees.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "She does not have to. Her place in this story is not to approve.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "It is to remind men like you and the Maharaja that the land remembers longer than crowns do.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SERVANT"
   ],
   "text": "The Velinadu lady asks if your feet remember her verandah.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You heard many words today. Tell me one thing you learned.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "That treaties are nets. And that Velinadu does not let anyone else hold the rope.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Not bad. And what did you learn about yourself?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "That I am still a man the sea has not decided to keep.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And that I stand on land that can throw me off if I forget whose it is.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "That one? Sea or fort?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Dungeon. A Portuguese man with time and tools.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Travancore has its own tools.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Do not give us reason to use them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Go. Padmini will think I am trying to steal her new toy.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  }
 ]
}